---

<section id="member-store" class="w-full bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4 mb-12">
      <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-bold">
        Inside the member Store
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">See what is available in the Store.</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        <p>The public site shows you the Botanica range and how the dropper works.</p>
        <p>The private Store is where approved members can see current bottles, prices, availability, batch details, member offers and checkout.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <li class="border-t-2 border-secondary pt-5 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Current bottles</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">See what is available before you order.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t-2 border-secondary pt-5 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Member offers</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">See bundles and limited offers when they are available.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t-2 border-secondary pt-5 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Product details</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">See the current batch and full product information.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t-2 border-secondary pt-5 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Private checkout</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Add your bottles to your Bag and complete your order.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
